# Cloud.Api-copied SPA build output (Dockerfile Node stage produces this;
# design.md "SPA delivery" — never hand-authored, never committed). The
# directory itself must stay tracked (via wwwroot/.gitkeep, not ignored
# below) because Program.cs's UseStaticFiles() throws DirectoryNotFoundException
# if wwwroot doesn't physically exist -- this bit WebApplicationFactory-based
# integration tests in a clean checkout with no prior local SPA build.
src/Commerce.Cloud.Api/wwwroot/*
!src/Commerce.Cloud.Api/wwwroot/.gitkeep

# Local secrets; keep documented examples versioned
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample

# Local agent registry and cache
.atl/

# Playwright E2E run artifacts (src/Commerce.Web/e2e)
src/Commerce.Web/test-results/
src/Commerce.Web/playwright-report/
src/Commerce.Web/blob-report/
src/Commerce.Web/playwright/.cache/

# Local agent/runtime artifacts
.engram/
System.Management.Automation.Internal.Host.InternalHost
src/Commerce.Cloud.Api/Properties/launchSettings.json
